msgid ""
"Create ``.vscode/launch.json`` in the repository. The simplest case -- VS "
"Code, the J-Link, and the build are all on the **same** Linux / macOS "
"machine -- uses ``servertype: \"jlink\"``, which makes Cortex-Debug start a "
"J-Link GDB server itself::"
